00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:35.036
But then why would we all have
this reflexive urge to do it?

00:06:35.036 --> 00:06:36.420
Ow, son of a pinch.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:39.553
So having a jiggy day might
be a good thing. Fungi.

